---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Learning | Portfolio"
  description="Education, courses and continuous learning in software development and technology."
  lang="en"
>
  <article class="learning-page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">LEARNING</p>

      <h1>Education and continuous learning</h1>

      <p class="intro">
        Academic education, specialized training and courses completed to expand
        my knowledge in software development, web development, programming and
        technology.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="learning-content">
      <section class="learning-section">
        <header class="section-header">
          <p class="section-label">EDUCATION</p>
          <h2>Main education</h2>
        </header>

        <div class="learning-list">
          <article class="learning-item">
            <h3>Multiplatform Application Development</h3>

            <p class="learning-type">Higher Technician qualification · DAM</p>

            <p>
              Higher vocational education focused on multiplatform application
              development, programming, databases, web development and different
              software technologies.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="learning-item">
            <h3>Master Full Stack Development</h3>

            <p class="learning-type">
              MasterD · Specialized non-official training
            </p>

            <p>
              Specialized training in Full Stack Development, expanding
              knowledge related to frontend, backend and web application
              development.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="learning-section">
        <header class="section-header">
          <p class="section-label">COURSES</p>
          <h2>Courses and specialization</h2>
        </header>

        <div class="course-list">
          <article class="course-item">
            <h3>Java and Object-Oriented Programming</h3>
            <p>
              Training in Java and object-oriented programming fundamentals.
            </p>
            <span class="course-provider">Mouredev</span>
          </article>

          <article class="course-item">
            <h3>Python Essentials 1</h3>
            <p>Training in Python programming fundamentals.</p>
            <span class="course-provider">Cisco</span>
          </article>

          <article class="course-item">
            <h3>Python Essentials 2</h3>
            <p>Further training within the Python Essentials learning path.</p>
            <span class="course-provider">Cisco</span>
          </article>

          <article class="course-item">
            <h3>JavaScript Essentials 1</h3>
            <p>
              Training in JavaScript fundamentals and programming for web
              applications.
            </p>
            <span class="course-provider">Cisco</span>
          </article>

          <article class="course-item">
            <h3>Introduction to Web Development</h3>
            <p>Introductory training in HTML and CSS.</p>
            <span class="course-provider">Google</span>
          </article>

          <article class="course-item">
            <h3>Introduction to Mobile Application Development</h3>
            <p>
              Introductory training related to mobile application development.
            </p>
            <span class="course-provider">Google</span>
          </article>

          <article class="course-item">
            <h3>Excel</h3>
            <p>Training in the use of Microsoft Excel.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="course-item">
            <h3>Prompt Engineering</h3>
            <p>
              Training in prompt design and the use of prompts when working with
              artificial intelligence systems.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="course-item">
            <h3>Responsible AI & Prompt Engineering</h3>
            <p>
              Training related to responsible artificial intelligence use and
              prompt engineering techniques.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="course-item">
            <h3>Cybersecurity for Remote Work</h3>
            <p>
              Training related to cybersecurity good practices in remote work
              environments.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="learning-section">
        <header class="section-header">
          <p class="section-label">APPROACH</p>
          <h2>How I keep learning</h2>
        </header>

        <div class="learning-text">
          <p>
            My learning is not limited to courses. In professional projects, I
            have also had to research new technologies, tools and configurations
            to solve specific problems.
          </p>

          <p>
            This approach has allowed me to learn especially through practice:
            understanding a problem, researching alternatives, testing a
            solution and adapting it to a real environment.
          </p>

          <p>
            I am currently interested in continuing to deepen my knowledge of
            software development, backend development, web development,
            automation and application architecture.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .learning-page {
    width: min(calc(100% - 2rem), var(--content-width));
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-block: 4rem 6rem;
  }

  .page-header {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .eyebrow,
  .section-label {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 750px;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .learning-content {
    max-width: 950px;
  }

  .learning-section {
    padding-block: 4rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .learning-section:first-child {
    padding-top: 0;
    border-top: 0;
  }

  .section-header {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .section-header h2 {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .learning-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .learning-item {
    padding: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .learning-item h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .learning-type {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .course-list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .course-item {
    display: flex;
    min-height: 190px;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .course-item h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .course-item p {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .course-provider {
    margin-top: auto;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .learning-text {
    max-width: 750px;
  }

  .learning-text p + p {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .learning-page {
      padding-block: 3rem 5rem;
    }

    .page-header {
      margin-bottom: 4rem;
    }

    .learning-section {
      padding-block: 3rem;
    }

    .course-list {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .learning-item,
    .course-item {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
